{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13214210","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13214210","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1321421001:1":{"text":"怎么样，你现在感觉还好吗？","source_cn":"怎么样，你现在感觉还好吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x73BE1BCEF18D4447","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321421002:1":{"text":"确实好多了……伤口没有之前那么疼，出血好像也止住了。","source_cn":"确实好多了……伤口没有之前那么疼，出血好像也止住了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3A34D0962FDFB95","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321421003:1":{"text":"是啊，哥哥你的脸色都好了不少呢！","source_cn":"是啊，哥哥你的脸色都好了不少呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x936F75508D3A2620","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321421004:1":{"text":"今天的事都要感谢你们。不但一直陪着彼得，还帮了我这么多。","source_cn":"今天的事都要感谢你们。不但一直陪着彼得，还帮了我这么多。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x13FAB5CD25C65017","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"今天的事都要感谢你们。不但一直陪着彼得，还帮了我这么多。","female":"今天的事都要感谢你们。不但一直陪着彼得，还帮了我这么多。","variant_male_record_index":"150344","variant_female_record_index":"150345","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1321421005:1":{"text":"不用客气！其实我们来找你，也是有事想要问你。","source_cn":"不用客气！其实我们来找你，也是有事想要问你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53BF2C65988C8EC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1321421006:1":{"text":"你知道卡明斯基家族吗？听镇上的老人说，他们在白山公国的亲戚只剩下你们一家了。","source_cn":"你知道卡明斯基家族吗？听镇上的老人说，他们在白山公国的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5664717496CB6B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1321421007:1":{"text":"我的确知道一些事。但我得冒昧问一句，你们为什么要打听卡明斯基的事？","source_cn":"我的确知道一些事。但我得冒昧问一句，你们为什么要打听卡...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD52721557518CB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1321421007":{"text":"我的确知道一些事。但我得冒昧问一句，你们为什么要打听卡明斯基的事？","source_cn":"我的确知道一些事。但我得冒昧问一句，你们为什么要打听卡明斯基的事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD52721557518CB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1321421008:1":{"text":"战士？不对啊，卡明斯基家族很久都没有出过战士了……","source_cn":"战士？不对啊，卡明斯基家族很久都没有出过战士了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD33C7939538DCC3F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1321421009:1":{"text":"你看了这个护身符就都明白了！","source_cn":"你看了这个护身符就都明白了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52E156A0C344C411","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:15::0":{"text":"破旧的护身符","source_cn":"破旧的护身符","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x471FF9DFE336B376","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1321421012:1":{"text":"“愿女神保佑扬·卡明斯基”……？！","source_cn":"“愿女神保佑扬·卡明斯基”……？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B382F87428761A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1321421013:1":{"text":"这是我们在一个活死人身上找到的东西。你应该还不知道……徘徊在古战场的这些活死人，其实就是当年参与神魔大战的战士。","source_cn":"这是我们在一个活死人身上找到的东西。你应该还不知道……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4A2BAFA3644F18E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1321421014:1":{"text":"我想，那位战士生前一定非常英勇，所以直到死后依然坚守在这里，想要将恶魔赶走。","source_cn":"我想，那位战士生前一定非常英勇，所以直到死后依然坚守在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03AC966DEF5B34F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1321421015:1":{"text":"所以我们才想把这枚护身符还给他的后裔。","source_cn":"所以我们才想把这枚护身符还给他的后裔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B25BF314CEFB0B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1321421016:1":{"text":"原来……竟然是这样……！","source_cn":"原来……竟然是这样……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0CED324175FB11D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1321421017:1":{"text":"哥哥你这么激动干嘛？卡明斯基的事和我们又没什么关系。","source_cn":"哥哥你这么激动干嘛？卡明斯基的事和我们又没什么关系。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE8BDE3C909B80F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1321421018:1":{"text":"没关系？！怎么可能没关系！卡明斯基……彼得，我们就是卡明斯基！这才是我们真正的姓氏！","source_cn":"没关系？！怎么可能没关系！卡明斯基……彼得，我们就是卡...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D1DFE63853CDE55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1321421019:1":{"text":"……啊？！","source_cn":"……啊？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23839CC3CB9C29D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1321421020:1":{"text":"什么？！你们不是姓卡列夫吗？！","source_cn":"什么？！你们不是姓卡列夫吗？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F76903D62792DB5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1321421021:1":{"text":"卡列夫只是一个后改的姓！你们看，这是我父母临终时交给我的传家戒指，上面还有卡明斯基家族的纹章！","source_cn":"卡列夫只是一个后改的姓！你们看，这是我父母临终时交给我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBDCF0A66945505B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1321421022:1":{"text":"和护身符背面的纹章一样……居然是真的。","source_cn":"和护身符背面的纹章一样……居然是真的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50237FB02E43D4C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1321421023:1":{"text":"是啊……我也从来没想过，居然有机会从别人口中听到夸耀卡明斯基家族的话……","source_cn":"是啊……我也从来没想过，居然有机会从别人口中听到夸耀卡...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3AE30FCEA575E193","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1321421024:1":{"text":"为什么这么说？现在雪松镇镇民们的先祖，不都是对抗恶魔的战士吗？","source_cn":"为什么这么说？现在雪松镇镇民们的先祖，不都是对抗恶魔的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x608F6A2028D4A013","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1321421025:1":{"text":"是的，但我们那位先祖……在镇上惹出过乱子。","source_cn":"是的，但我们那位先祖……在镇上惹出过乱子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E09604AA86E0B12","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1321421026:1":{"text":"就像你们说的那样，我们的先祖的确变成了活死人。然后……他曾经试图返回镇子，回到家里与家人团聚。","source_cn":"就像你们说的那样，我们的先祖的确变成了活死人。然后……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04414330E1A8F4C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1321421027:1":{"text":"那恐怕会吓坏不少人吧？","source_cn":"那恐怕会吓坏不少人吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F42EDA4AC2489C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1321421028:1":{"text":"没错。大家都以为活死人是恶魔的眷属，以为卡明斯基的先祖背叛了女神，放弃了荣耀，投靠了恶魔……","source_cn":"没错。大家都以为活死人是恶魔的眷属，以为卡明斯基的先祖...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D770104C7C2B582","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1321421029:1":{"text":"从那之后，卡明斯基的后裔就背上了恶名。所有人都唾弃我们，指责我们流淌着背叛者的血脉……","source_cn":"从那之后，卡明斯基的后裔就背上了恶名。所有人都唾弃我们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC02D304C8D44CD61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1321421030:1":{"text":"最可怕的是，家族中一些无从得知真相的人也渐渐相信先祖曾经与恶魔勾结。一些人放弃了卡明斯基的姓氏，搬到郊外，就像我们一家……更多人则是干脆离开了白山公国。","source_cn":"最可怕的是，家族中一些无从得知真相的人也渐渐相信先祖曾...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9AB36C9CB4AADA8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1321421031:1":{"text":"直到现在，依然留在白山公国境内的卡明斯基后裔，应该只有我和彼得两人了。不过，很多人早就不记得我们和卡明斯基家族的关系了。","source_cn":"直到现在，依然留在白山公国境内的卡明斯基后裔，应该只有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF912D6576C098176","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1321421032:1":{"text":"这些事你从来都没告诉过我！爸妈也没和我讲过……","source_cn":"这些事你从来都没告诉过我！爸妈也没和我讲过……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14AEFA8FE63A7ECA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1321421033:1":{"text":"抱歉，彼得……对你而言，很多事还是不知道的好。","source_cn":"抱歉，彼得……对你而言，很多事还是不知道的好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E340F3E48211148","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1321421034:1":{"text":"而且我一直觉得……在我加入公国卫队以后，也许可以用自己的功劳为家族恢复名誉。","source_cn":"而且我一直觉得……在我加入公国卫队以后，也许可以用自己...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B9AB9B9638DF2B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:47:1321421034":{"text":"而且我一直觉得……在我加入公国卫队以后，也许可以用自己的功劳为家族恢复名誉。","source_cn":"而且我一直觉得……在我加入公国卫队以后，也许可以用自己的功劳为家族恢复名誉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B9AB9B9638DF2B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1321421035:1":{"text":"是的。","source_cn":"是的。<key:dialog32>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x299514988EB51459","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1321421039:1":{"text":"可是，在我被开除之后，在我听到别人骂我是懦夫的时候……我开始后悔那天放走那个活死人了。","source_cn":"可是，在我被开除之后，在我听到别人骂我是懦夫的时候……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC447A100EEF192D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1321421040:1":{"text":"我来这里和活死人战斗，就是想证明自己，证明卡明斯基家族绝没有大家说的那么不堪！","source_cn":"我来这里和活死人战斗，就是想证明自己，证明卡明斯基家族...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A042DFA5FD37049","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:51:1321421040":{"text":"我来这里和活死人战斗，就是想证明自己，证明卡明斯基家族绝没有大家说的那么不堪！","source_cn":"我来这里和活死人战斗，就是想证明自己，证明卡明斯基家族绝没有大家说的那么不堪！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A042DFA5FD37049","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1321421041:1":{"text":"没错……我们的先祖不是懦夫，而是一位英勇的战士！是和女将军一样的、真正的英雄！","source_cn":"没错……我们的先祖不是懦夫，而是一位英勇的战士！是和女...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9491E80C68918ED6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1321421042:1":{"text":"太好了，彼得……我们以后再也不用因为是卡明斯基的后裔而抬不起头了，而是应该为先祖感到自豪！","source_cn":"太好了，彼得……我们以后再也不用因为是卡明斯基的后裔而...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5CE57A40A37CF51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_fem